WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:06,790
Don't worry, it's me

2
00:00:06,790 --> 00:00:08,670
You are addicted and they bully me

3
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:11,310
Then why are you looking for them to find me? I'm hungry.

4
00:00:11,310 --> 00:00:12,870
Someone brought me a watch worth more than one million yuan

5
00:00:12,870 --> 00:00:14,030
I asked him to take it back

6
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:16,510
Why are you coming to me empty-handed now asking for something to eat?

7
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:18,830
I think you're worth more than that watch. I'm not here to paint.

8
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:19,910
I work

9
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:22,390
Aren't you becoming a provincial? Teach me

10
00:00:22,390 --> 00:00:24,590
First tear off the outer skin and roll it into a drum

11
00:00:24,590 --> 00:00:25,510
Reverse you again

12
00:00:25,510 --> 00:00:31,220
I'm so frugal and have no food, Miss Xu

13
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:33,180
Do you usually have someone stir the meal for you?

14
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:34,700
A province can still be dispersed even if it is beaten three times

15
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,580
You're so weird, it's my first time to do it

16
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:38,500
Whoever is born will be born with sex. Come again.

17
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:48,220
Barely qualified. Slow down and no one will grab it.

18
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:50,020
You don’t know what we eat there?

19
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:51,100
How many mouthfuls of conch per person?

20
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:53,060
The crabs were still half-cooked

21
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:55,020
No one here cares who your father is and who wants to eat meat.

22
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:56,380
Just exchange for what you can use now.

23
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:57,580
Four words: down payment of thousands of catties

24
00:00:57,580 --> 00:00:58,620
Can't fill my stomach
